    "body": "Part of #36692. This keeps `CMutableTransaction` as the builder, since a `CTransaction` constructor taking inputs and outputs directly is still under discussion. Once one exists, these call sites can be converted to construct `CTransaction` directly.\r\n\r\nThis PR covers the mempool-related files.\r\n\r\nThis change is test- and bench-only and does not change the constructed transactions. \r\n\r\nNotes for reviewers: two spots in `rbf_tests` that modify an existing transaction as part of the test logic are intentionally left unchanged.",
